        "type": "game",
        "name": "The Adventures of Emilie in Paris",
        "steam_appid": 4028870,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028870/extras/8b53ff10e65a2370d21230d94418053c.apng?t=1773267093\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028870/extras/8b53ff10e65a2370d21230d94418053c.poster.avif?t=1773267093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=148 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Independent 2D platform game</strong> that pays tribute to the classics of the 90s, while bringing <strong>humor</strong>, a modern and <strong>personal touch</strong>. This game combines familiar traps and enemies with new ideas like climbing a drainpipe to run across rooftops as if doing &quot;parkour&quot;, to offer <strong>an original experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated time to complete the game: 2h30 - 5h00 for a first playthrough (Normal mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels for great replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine stands out with certain animations inspired by real movements created using rotoscoping (running, jumping, climbing from the drainpipe to the roof), offering <strong>great fluidity</strong>. The animation work on the heroine alone took 3 months of work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers <strong>very varied levels</strong>, ranging from exteriors (chic neighborhoods, neighborhoods with dilapidated buildings) to interiors (metro, catacombs, sewers), including nocturnal, snowy or aerial atmospheres. Humorous nods are present to a well-known series: I show the Paris of chic neighborhoods, but then I also show the less glamorous Paris with trash cans, dilapidated buildings with broken windows, dog poop on the sidewalk, the sewers. For those who know the series and Paris, there are humorous moments.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028870/extras/8b53ff10e65a2370d21230d94418053c.apng?t=1773267093\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028870/extras/8b53ff10e65a2370d21230d94418053c.poster.avif?t=1773267093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=148 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Independent 2D platform game</strong> that pays tribute to the classics of the 90s, while bringing <strong>humor</strong>, a modern and <strong>personal touch</strong>. This game combines familiar traps and enemies with new ideas like climbing a drainpipe to run across rooftops as if doing &quot;parkour&quot;, to offer <strong>an original experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated time to complete the game: 2h30 - 5h00 for a first playthrough (Normal mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels for great replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine stands out with certain animations inspired by real movements created using rotoscoping (running, jumping, climbing from the drainpipe to the roof), offering <strong>great fluidity</strong>. The animation work on the heroine alone took 3 months of work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers <strong>very varied levels</strong>, ranging from exteriors (chic neighborhoods, neighborhoods with dilapidated buildings) to interiors (metro, catacombs, sewers), including nocturnal, snowy or aerial atmospheres. Humorous nods are present to a well-known series: I show the Paris of chic neighborhoods, but then I also show the less glamorous Paris with trash cans, dilapidated buildings with broken windows, dog poop on the sidewalk, the sewers. For those who know the series and Paris, there are humorous moments.</p>",
        "short_description": "A stylish heroine in an imperfect, living Paris. 2D platformer with unique animations: climb Haussmann rooftops, escape through catacombs, traverse grimy backstreets. Between elegance and urban reality, discover a city far from postcards, with humor and grace.",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal",
        "reviews": "“a bite-sized, well-crafted gaming treat”<br>15/20 – geek-o-polis<br><br>“An indie platformer with soul, humor, and plenty of style”<br>La Cueva Virtual<br><br>“A love letter to classic 2D platformers with a very strong artistic identity.”<br>Indistation<br>",
